# The Wonder Magic Set (jeuno 7): the key item held while the quest is available (GM; Jeuno fame 0, level 1, so 77 is
# not offered), then again once completed: Panta-Putta's 33 plays in any status (the key item arm reads none) and its
# finish completes the quest each time (from available: never begun). Quest[3][7]Prog 1 (GM) kept (the raw
# player:completeQuest).
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-60.8,-0.3,-140.0 job=WAR lvl=75
keyitem WonderMagicSet
login
charvar Quest[3][7]Prog 1               # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Panta-Putta                     # available (fame level 1), the key item held: 33
finish                                  # completed from available; the earring; the key item taken
keyitem WonderMagicSet                  # GM: the key item again
trigger Panta-Putta                     # completed, the key item held: 33
finish                                  # a second earring, title, fame; completeQuest again
